            "item_title": "Business Management Support",
            "item_desc": "<ul>\n<li>A Business Manager assigned to your salon to give support and promote the growth of your salon</li>\n<li>Assistance prior to your salon opening and during your crucial first few weeks. Fortnightly visits during the first three months and then once every four weeks (or as you need us).</li>\n<li>Guidance in business planning, marketing, public relations and sales initiatives</li>\n<li>Up-to-date information on your stock transactions</li>\n<li>Assistance in motivating and focusing your salon team to help them achieve</li>\n</ul>"
