            "item_desc": "<ul>\n<li>Education and training for you and your team in the latest skincare treatments, techniques and products</li>\n<li>Help to maintain and improve your product and treatment sales, and effective product merchandising in your salon</li>\n<li>Education for your team on campaign strategies</li>\n<li>In-salon training and promotional activity, where appropriate</li>\n</ul>"
