    "franchise-ourSupport-3-col-grid-layout": {
      "type": "franchise-ourSupport-3-col-grid-layout",
      "blocks": {
        "9c29b70a-b510-4f3b-b769-57e032271041": {
          "type": "Article",
          "settings": {
            "item_icon_img": "shopify://shop_images/icon-support.png",
            "item_title": "Marketing Support",
            "item_desc": "<p>When you're part of the Ella Baché family, you'll reap the benefits of our strong brand and the support of an accomplished marketing team.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Our commitment to consistently reinvigorating ourselves through progressive skincare research and product development, as well as strategic brand marketing, has carved a market-leading niche for us</li>\n<li>We provide a monthly promotional plan that is supported with professionally designed point-of-sale material, as well as a national advertising and public relations campaign</li>\n<li>Our marketing initiatives are supported via co-operative advertising and rebate programs</li>\n<li>We provide local area marketing support through the creation of templates and have invested in a new website with market leading digital capabilities, in conjunction with our virtual salons</li>\n</ul>"
          }
        },
        "e10ad433-4461-460e-b7c8-2857d17ba8d7": {
          "type": "Article",
          "settings": {
            "item_icon_img": "shopify://shop_images/icon-statistics.png",
            "item_title": "Business Benchmarking",
            "item_desc": "<p>The family oriented nature of our company inspires Salon Owners across the network to share business and management intelligence, performance tips, best practice protocols and margin strategies to achieve greater returns.</p>\n<p>The benefits of our collaborative approach to franchise networking are many. One of the biggest benefits is that you can benchmark your business performance against your peers in a transparent and collaborative environment. You have the opportunity to share your challenges with fellow Salon Owners to learn how they've coped in similar circumstances and share your solutions to help your peers grow.</p>\n<p>These strategic alliances are offered formally (in group sessions) or one-on-one, if requested.</p>"
          }
        },
        "724ce4a7-e894-451f-b2b2-23b248ad6868": {
          "type": "Article",
          "settings": {
            "item_icon_img": "shopify://shop_images/icon-star_f79c8c1e-1f22-42f7-81e9-ff0e40583e6d.png",
            "item_title": "Recognition",
            "item_desc": "<p>A job well done deserves a reward. We recognise passion and hard work in a variety of ways, including:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>National incentive programs for Beauty Therapists, Salon Teams and Salon Owners</li>\n<li>Our Annual 'Ella Awards', an opportunity for therapists and salon owners to shine amongst their peers. This glamorous event recognises the performance of top salons, and elects individuals in each state for outstanding performance and commitment.</li>\n<li>Generous incentive offers for our top performers including cash rewards, training and trips away!</li>\n</ul>"
          }
        },
        "97644b6e-f3e5-4deb-a262-59f83c3722a4": {
          "type": "Article",
          "settings": {
            "item_icon_img": "shopify://shop_images/icon-monitor.png",
            "item_title": "Virtual Salon",
            "item_desc": "<p>Your own dedicated page for clients to browse your menu of services, special offers and book appointments online, as well as to promote your own local area initiatives and awards.</p>"
          }
        },
        "89d39bf6-cea4-4669-a6ca-6b310515782d": {
          "type": "Article",
          "settings": {
            "item_icon_img": "shopify://shop_images/icon-conference_7ad30157-1101-432e-b29b-a1d4b8961775.png",
            "item_title": "Annual Business Owners Conference",
            "item_desc": "<p>When you're part of the Ella Baché franchise group, you're part of a dynamic group of entrepreneurs. Each year, we offer salon owners the opportunity to attend our conference to acquire:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Business tools to improve your operational efficiency</li>\n<li>Ideas to inspire business development</li>\n<li>Opportunities for professional growth through networking</li>\n</ul>"
          }
        },
        "9b7fbcdf-2f83-4231-b912-2c262d1b3276": {
          "type": "Article",
          "settings": {
            "item_icon_img": "shopify://shop_images/icon-counsil.png",
            "item_title": "Advisory Council",
            "item_desc": "<p>Constructive, open and two-way communication between all Ella Baché franchisees and management is a crucial element of our solid franchise partnerships. Our advisory council exists to:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Actively identifying new business opportunities and develop them in conjunction with our network of salon owners</li>\n<li>Continually improve our professionalism, research and development, and operational efficiency</li>\n</ul>"
          }
        }
      },
